":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/xzklXcTIOCo17HMDz0aWtdvz35ehS098.ogg"},{"description":"Mashiro_ExSkill_2.ogg","category":"battle","text":"目標を確認、排除します！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/wyqRSP5xPzuo5rHU9NlcdlQoKLzzwtCb.ogg"},{"description":"Mashiro_ExSkill_3.ogg","category":"battle","text":"ターゲット補足…距離は十分です。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/sl6hDvTz3wrVEa7XiJK8mr0DUVfMSesw.ogg"},{"description":"Mashiro_ExSkill_Level_1.ogg","category":"battle","text":"ファイア！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/dzQ8TrKkCsi6MOZisfjzGkjLJlR0oTpj.ogg"},{"description":"Mashiro_ExSkill_Level_2.ogg","category":"battle","text":"命中です。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/rQdTX4uEoo5Md78nGkgdcBg9GMZG2iRC.ogg"},{"description":"Mashiro_ExSkill_Level_3.ogg","category":"battle","text":"ヒット！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/xEQhT8HEW89g4WNMgO0cF02FBzS8VlPk.ogg"},{"description":"Mashiro_ExWeapon_Get.ogg","category":"growup","text":"これぞ…… 本当の正義……。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/zigyNyXmjiQHMogdtKLdYwzpUnwmiGON.ogg"},{"description":"Mashiro_Formation_In_1.ogg","category":"formation","text":"ベストを尽くします。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/OKJbKce7HURCImWZUo7JjwWEtonwdk6t.ogg"},{"description":"Mashiro_Formation_In_2.ogg","category":"formation","text":"ご期待に答えてみせます。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/iClBxXs7nG684wfCxns1Bqh8JIXH7DNG.ogg"},{"description":"Mashiro_Gachaget.ogg","category":"growup","text":"正義実現委員会1年生マシロ、お呼びが掛かりましたのでこちらに。 未熟者ですが、いついかなる時もベストを尽くします。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/Yy6mDTeJPzr4mdVqB3df7kvaZoXDlflZ.ogg"},{"description":"Mashiro_Growup_1.ogg","category":"growup","text":"支援、感謝します。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/JHJUmAZFWKt7c3DIq9Ry9Fap1HTfcfGH.ogg"},{"description":"Mashiro_Growup_2.ogg","category":"growup","text":"巨大な力を感じられますね。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/kfHTZBgbKigcKs9SozbTQEkSYwYCoYVf.ogg"},{"description":"Mashiro_Growup_3.ogg","category":"growup","text":"ふん…正義が思い上がります。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/VwlcVrHdCH5sTJtbSn4ZBYm3aUNh6MYN.ogg"},{"description":"Mashiro_Growup_4.ogg","category":"growup","text":"正義のために、頑張ります。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/n81d0ge7vw4ySoYJRKDvxfffttjoOy5Z.ogg"},{"description":"Mashiro_Lobby_1.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"あ、出撃ですか？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/4bMQMAVri5hqfcN6RdMCLZLfz82yLviJ.ogg"},{"description":"Mashiro_Lobby_2.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"お呼びですか、先生？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/GACjiOo7Xzl0tdgzxi1ayElXPHvpSigf.ogg"},{"description":"Mashiro_Lobby_3.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"私たち正義実現委員会の目標は悪を滅し、 この学園の正義を立て直すこと…です。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/ClLaA7uEbKHa8i3VmxIqMU6uGCBCOKDA.ogg"},{"description":"Mashiro_Lobby_4.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"正義を実現させるためには、苦しい訓練だろうと神経をすり減らす試練だろうと、いくらでも耐えると誓いましたが… 先輩たちと一緒に過ごす時間があまりにも楽しくて…僭越ですが思わず正義のことを忘れてしまいそうです。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/knKQflxwGzCGSGNFZAIis936RfNijQWz.ogg"},{"description":"Mashiro_Lobby_5.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"あのう…念のために申し上げますが、今触っているのは作戦用コンソールではありません…。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/45PajELnmE8Bf5xmz3zuXB7TZwl3001K.ogg"},{"description":"Mashiro_LogIn_1.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"ようこそ、先生。今日も一緒に、正義のために頑張りましょう。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/jh086t9iDG6bQ0VryGC3rTXPDf4CQFuF.ogg"},{"description":"Mashiro_LogIn_2.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"お待ちしておりました。すぐにでもご命令を。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/oLjncuIWqJfFWGQlALD6lWREZyJo4xis.ogg"},{"description":"Mashiro_MemorialLobby_1.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"ふう…。 今日に限って暑いですね。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/7bOgzmGzplWoDChW13VQMTwQ37c8D79C.ogg"},{"description":"Mashiro_MemorialLobby_2.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"完璧な狙撃のためなら、これぐらいの暑さは十分耐えられます。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/fb5DvUg6p67nC976WjOOwNMliPzFJxen.ogg"},{"description":"Mashiro_MemorialLobby_3.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"少し…汗臭かったりしないかな…？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/YoUQyjMn0W7Km06ZpTL1p5hAujtQ4HSe.ogg"},{"description":"Mashiro_MemorialLobby_4.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"こんな夏の日には、他の生徒たちの白い制服が羨ましいですね。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/F51KTxX7m9D3e6P8gcbPxOQjAcMpemuI.ogg"},{"description":"Mashiro_MemorialLobby_5_1.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"先生…なんだか視線がいやらしい気がしますが…。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/GzhgkJ66lOzDtpraUg71npqSxJNgauQH.ogg"},{"description":"Mashiro_MemorialLobby_5_2.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"きちんと目標を注視されているんですよね？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/MDAkG9u1fSxCnS6zBTlPFsclLBdXctg3.ogg"},{"description":"Mashiro_Relationship_Up_1.ogg","category":"growup","text":"先生の持つ正義はきっと格好いい正義なのでしょう。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/3nVqsw6eWQ5MRpPrjC5pWag21HfKrciJ.ogg"},{"description":"Mashiro_Relationship_Up_2.ogg","category":"growup","text":"もしも先生が悪の行いをしたら、その時は…。いや、そんなはずありません！先生は正義そのものですから！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/1DjsgtlOqecjeYpTKrLH0P2OvYCCwT5l.ogg"},{"description":"Mashiro_Relationship_Up_3.ogg","category":"growup","text":"先生と一緒に過ごす時間はなんだかいつも短く感じます。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/7W1JYBXguivFoG4MfdZVdYnhuuByVgxh.ogg"},{"description":"Mashiro_Relationship_Up_4.ogg","category":"growup","text":"好きです、本当に……。も、もちろん、正義のことです！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/seGnrI71CnZYlHGS50u70vHBdlTglz13.ogg"},{"description":"Mashiro_Season_Birthday","category":"lobby","text":"そうですか。今日が私の誕生日だったんですね…。 すっかり忘れてました。気にかけてくださって、ありがとうございます。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/original/Mashiro_Season_Birthday.ogg"},{"description":"Mashiro_Season_Birthday_Player","category":"lobby","text":"お誕生日おめでとうございます、先生。 先生の一日が正義で満たされるよう、お祈りします。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/original/Mashiro_Season_Birthday_Player.ogg"},{"description":"Mashiro_Season_Halloween","category":"lobby","text":"トリニティのすべての聖人を称える祝日が始まりました。 カボチャのお化け…？悪い夢でも見ましたか？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/original/Mashiro_Season_Halloween.ogg"},{"description":"Mashiro_Season_NewYear","category":"lobby","text":"明けましておめでとうございます。今年こそ、この地から悪を完全に追い出せるよう、さらに努力します。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/original/Mashiro_Season_NewYear.ogg"},{"description":"Mashiro_Season_Xmas","category":"lobby","text":"トリニティの聖なる日ですね。このような日でも、ゲヘナの悪党たちは悪行をなしているんでしょうか…。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/original/Mashiro_Season_Xmas.ogg"}],"voice_cn":[{"description":"mashiro_relationship_up_4","category":"growup","text":"我真的……很喜欢……啊，当，当然说的是正义。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/VoVS6lq9jartWHhJSUMk0qPWZjC4d9C5.ogg"},{"description":"mashiro_season_birthday","category":"lobby","text":"原来如此，今天是我的生日啊。 我忘得一干二净。 谢谢您这么为我着想。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/gBK6myutxw4tJ5ig9T4iB67bLKbnSMEb.ogg"},{"description":"mashiro_season_birthday_player","category":"lobby","text":"老师，祝您生日快乐。 衷心祝愿今天的老师一身正气。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/LTu8ZaHH66VXXLZ9LnuHmLrpdGiYKPUE.ogg"},{"description":"mashiro_season_chinesenewyear","category":"lobby","text":"老师，恭祝您新春快乐，今年也一起维护正义吧！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/XzW9W9SEaazb6oAfxqAxKecVkeIy0RyY.ogg"},{"description":"mashiro_season_halloween","category":"lobby","text":"称颂崔尼蒂所有贤者的节日来临了。 嗯？南瓜妖怪……？您做恶梦了吗？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/Ul9Aba2Y2q8CKvxT5YoBjnsXtwNvPafK.ogg"},{"description":"mashiro_season_midautumn","category":"lobby","text":"我很喜欢这个节日，在皎洁的月光下，一切邪恶都无处遁形。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/Lyc0aTjUJbkaRMzpsihT0iPtHAFhXTIz.ogg"},{"description":"mashiro_season_newyear","category":"lobby","text":"恭祝您新春快乐。今年， 我一定要再接再厉，彻底消灭掉这个地方的邪恶。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/uhNARN4faWZ6hNYzaxuTsU59SKSeULJQ.ogg"},{"description":"mashiro_season_xmas","category":"lobby","text":"今天对崔尼蒂来说是一个重要的日子。 在这样的日子里，歌赫娜的恶徒们还会不会为非作歹呢……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/JL8UHeTOvgUJpGKx5t1yDHw2AmGKZgxs.ogg"},{"description":"mashiro_title","category":"lobby","text":"Blue Archive","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/9ZzKmrhgZRx43BzQhp58ijrUnkBGN1yM.ogg"},{"description":"mashiro_battle_in_1","category":"battle","text":"全体就位。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/9nL6pQykfMPnyVO2m8RpXLg0PonSk04f.ogg"},{"description":"mashiro_battle_in_2","category":"battle","text":"战斗开始。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/F7v5d9fzygYLgbtC3MSJ4QfkMluVK3ng.ogg"},{"description":"mashiro_battle_tsa_1","category":"battle","text":"实现正义的时候到了。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/Qwnm9YZ9quk1fceapgS5OZow4WVbxzB3.ogg"},{"description":"mashiro_cafe_act_1","category":"cafe","text":"偶尔来下这种地方也挺不错的。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/lqyBp5nkx7UpkEz94bUQWigRNiSoyJ9A.ogg"},{"description":"mashiro_cafe_act_2","category":"cafe","text":"真可爱……嘿嘿。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/fj1NseKaxXQUOgWHO7Mk05auBiY9uSaR.ogg"},{"description":"mashiro_cafe_monolog_1","category":"cafe","text":"（鹤城前辈喜不喜欢这样的装饰呢……）","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/Yiuco1MSxMMzz3S6d0S7H1vrV67Nxjdr.ogg"},{"description":"mashiro_cafe_monolog_2","category":"cafe","text":"（莲见前辈的翅膀会不会就和这个家具一样柔软呢。）","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/lOAQu5PO9Bw3lRl0YqMOXiOeJZt5Kbu5.ogg"},{"description":"mashiro_cafe_monolog_3","category":"cafe","text":"（心如止水……）","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/l0NARqui5aRW3U8uDzqyBe3W9JI2HrCD.ogg"},{"description":"mashiro_cafe_monolog_4","category":"cafe","text":"（鹤城前辈的脖子应该没事吧……？）","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/a01lkc4JQ4FoT1q4sdUGtv0tU0fg2dFB.ogg"},{"description":"mashiro_commonskill","category":"battle","text":"还剩一个。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/GUsQsymGjJIKgTTZEnCk2qhAxZu7cjmg.ogg"},{"description":"mashiro_exskill_1","category":"battle","text":"装填完毕，瞄准无误，开始射击。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/8lVNBTUj3gqH4OHWKmSA3RjRjAP0QN21.ogg"},{"description":"mashiro_exskill_2","category":"battle","text":"目标已确认，开始清除。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/4aCeRiSNto01YV2aulAtgqqUSB8F0zOJ.ogg"},{"description":"mashiro_exskill_3","category":"battle","text":"已发现目标，在射程范围内。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/idRAAsHvXYUzKT6h1Sq74PatpcEtEApV.ogg"},{"description":"mashiro_exskill_level_1","category":"battle","text":"开火。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/2IO3c0TSpRavIp7gbbuW5GaT4FeKocUv.ogg"},{"description":"mashiro_exskill_level_2","category":"battle","text":"命中了。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/DPgOfmVNa2wcHVu7RLjwJ26qihzROMQk.ogg"},{"description":"mashiro_exskill_level_3","category":"battle","text":"中了。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/gRHDhoztBlj3CcL2CrN6rKSzstuLOv9B.ogg"},{"description":"mashiro_exweapon_get","category":"growup","text":"这……才是真正的正义……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/aTRn5YtAAFSFRpj52V4LtGwZyZEXq4hd.ogg"},{"description":"mashiro_formation_in_1","category":"formation","text":"我会尽全力的。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/2seZNEgkJTzgm17CcSt8HO1zHCUQkWmO.ogg"},{"description":"mashiro_formation_in_2","category":"formation","text":"不会辜负您的期待。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/koe2hYfT98sV05vcAtAde9ISMmPQbQxV.ogg"},{"description":"mashiro_gachaget","category":"growup","text":"正义实现部的新人真白，应召前来。虽然我还不太成熟，但任何时候我都会竭尽全力。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/ev1By6V5pYLBlF9jVgkyObH58sFcA3vK.ogg"},{"description":"mashiro_growup_1","category":"growup","text":"感谢您的支援。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/M1KhHvSFnFLOd9wa0oguoTE7ho9h1uY1.ogg"},{"description":"mashiro_growup_2","category":"growup","text":"可以感受到一股强大的力量。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/VL0vWZkqkbXvi14yOIh4sACSqohYr7yY.ogg"},{"description":"mashiro_growup_3","category":"growup","text":"哈，斗志燃烧起来了。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/7N9jjWibBs6dcispmpxds7JV3AuG0LOX.ogg"},{"description":"mashiro_growup_4","category":"growup","text":"为了正义，我会尽我所能。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/QI7x5knMMruR6IKyqNJE375BrIpNwsoK.ogg"},{"description":"mashiro_lobby_1","category":"lobby","text":"啊，要出击了吗？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/9x5qCQflM4IcBuMyY9dT0qzdqwplt2k5.ogg"},{"description":"mashiro_lobby_2","category":"lobby","text":"您找我吗，老师？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/RQxVDfzifcOJHPtALAkAVHfFbaWG0s0j.ogg"},{"description":"mashiro_lobby_3","category":"lobby","text":"我们正义实现部的目标， 是在崔尼蒂惩奸除恶，再次伸张正义！ ……就是这样。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/DBGK029CxBRLerPtCR4eQfU29gMF6FNM.ogg"},{"description":"mashiro_lobby_4","category":"lobby","text":"我发过誓，为了实现正义， 无论多么艰苦的训练，多么困难的考验， 我都会忍受下去…… 但是和前辈们在一起的时间又真的很快乐…… 快乐到好像连维护正义的事情都忘记了。有点不合适。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/XoFAjnxVkVitH0KCmMwH7fxBLJL5ocDG.ogg"},{"description":"mashiro_lobby_5","category":"lobby","text":"那个……慎重起见，我斗胆说一句…… 您现在摸的，并不是作战用的控制台……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/rzbMserqibxdVUCOx3qnYdP5aSYDimi8.ogg"},{"description":"mashiro_login_1","category":"lobby","text":"老师，您来了。今天也一起为了维护正义而努力吧。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/iCGfhzWOE5WJlw7Us9qOfPRxU8BL2a58.ogg"},{"description":"mashiro_login_2","category":"lobby","text":"等您很久了。请随时下达命令。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/T6A36fGIjS4XHCo20Ll9a9cG4ZGJICZ3.ogg"},{"description":"mashiro_memoriallobby_1","category":"lobby","text":"啊……怎么感觉今天特别热。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/zIVxtFmxQ1Z2OG5r4HbU4xrOf8TYu4S7.ogg"},{"description":"mashiro_memoriallobby_2","category":"lobby","text":"但为了完美的狙击，这种程度的酷热我还是可以忍受的。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/6dlQqR5FhCPF14j0NQMN0l5fKKENXOXs.ogg"},{"description":"mashiro_memoriallobby_3","category":"lobby","text":"就是……会不会……闻到一股汗味啊……？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/Cy1w70T85u1J5KJKDmtpdB1lzcwP3prO.ogg"},{"description":"mashiro_memoriallobby_4","category":"lobby","text":"一到这种大夏天，我就有点羡慕其他人穿的白色制服了。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/ykIM9RcRcF5LbghcDavAYGa0ALw2MtG8.ogg"},{"description":"mashiro_memoriallobby_5_1","category":"lobby","text":"老师……总感觉您的眼神好像有点不对劲……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/TW8gc446XLFUPj5GdSLCtGLLXl4oXLse.ogg"},{"description":"mashiro_memoriallobby_5_2","category":"lobby","text":"你应该是在认真地盯紧目标吧？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/zxhpib5dLTfUza9oExhrxJfOORjatmI0.ogg"},{"description":"mashiro_relationship_up_1","category":"growup","text":"老师心中的正义，一定是一种很酷的正义吧！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/Va9JUTmDujgK491MMGBL7BkwglNp7aDq.ogg"},{"description":"mashiro_relationship_up_2","category":"growup","text":"如果老师有一天做了坏事，那我就……不，不可能，毕竟老师就是正义的化身。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/Y8ysUUVVF4ca7FMD8ugoLNuP3sGhNioZ.ogg"},{"description":"mashiro_relationship_up_3","category":"growup","text":"总感觉，和老师在一起，时间就过得很快。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/2U4aybEFAiav3ecuFdvt8IloXvmgeSgk.ogg"}],"voice_kr":[{"description":"Mashiro_Title","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%99%E5%B1%B1%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%99%BD/original/Mashiro_Title.ogg"},{"description":"mashiro_cafe_act_1","category":"cafe","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E9%9D%